# Hyper Text

A dynamic text component that creates a scrambling/decoding animation effect, commonly seen in cyberpunk or tech-themed interfaces.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/hyper-text.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/hyper-text.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/hyper-text.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { HyperText } from '@/registry/hyper-text'
</script>

<template>
  <HyperText 
    text="HyperText Animation" 
    trigger="hover" 
  />
</template>
```

