### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `text` | `string` | `undefined` | The target text to reveal. |
| `duration` | `number` | `800` | Total animation duration in milliseconds. |
| `classes` | `string` | `''` | Additional CSS classes for the container. |
| `characterSet` | `string` | `A-Z, a-z, 0-9, symbols` | The characters used for the scrambling effect. |
| `trigger` | `string` | `'visible'` | What triggers the animation: `'visible'` (on scroll) or `'hover'`. |
| `colorClasses` | `Object` | `Standard theme colors` | CSS classes for the rendered and rendering states. |
